      "created_at": "2014-02-14T21:07:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>And rock a Tux, it's valentines day for goodness sake.</p><p>But seriously, we all love you, whoever you are that is currently reading this.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>And remember the real St. Valentine and why we commemorate him.</p><p>Because he helped poor horny Christians get married when Rome had made it illegal to do so. &nbsp;It's funny that Catholics and other conservative Christians are celebrating a man who defied the law to marry people simply because they loved each other.</p>",
